# Data for elementary actors in the eight-point binary-tree Sylow subgroup

The rows list the 241 elementary subgroups in the 128-element tree model.
The subsequent certificate verifies completeness by adjoining each commuting
involution. Multiplication and extension indices use packed integer rows;
none of the generated data is trusted without a kernel-checked identity.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith,12.6.28(2), printed pp.833--834.
-/
